# User-level factory enable policy — SavantOS desktop (FID-2026-0912-002).
#
# Plasma sessions run `systemctl --user preset-all` at first login; this
# file activates the identity oneshot that applies the Savant Look & Feel
# through Plasma's supported path, and the keep-awake loop that stops the
# idle blanking of the (headless-adjacent) VM output.
#
# Phase 3 (FID-2026-0915-005): savant-core joins the session. It binds NO
# capability at start (armed=false, mechanism=none) — the unit running is
# not the agent acting; fail-closed from first boot.

enable savantos-identity.service
enable savantos-keepawake.service
enable savant-core.service
